    "Completed DLS-only paired run scores18/18 in63.16s; student scores18/18 in52.84s (16.34% less simulation time). This supports a residual-associated benefit on seed1, concentrated in avoiding one existing PLACE timeout. All3 methods pass; do not equate nonzero residual use with full-task learning or general superiority.",
