    "residual_changed_command_calls counts that a residual affects a candidate command, not beneficial task contribution. Generic code records candidate servo rows before a possible DESCEND contact-stop override; no such override happened in the audited student run (count0).",
    "Trainer offline clamp counts use float32 analytic steps and a1e-12 threshold; use existing float64_guard_count_audit.json for corrected validation guard statistics. Runtime guard counts above are independently reproduced.",
